<title>ALBANIA: Albania details treasury bill auction results.</title>
<headline>Albania details treasury bill auction results.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issues of Albanian Government Treasury Bills auctions were announced by the Bank of Albania on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Auction No.139 of 91-day Albanian Government Treasury Bills</p>
<p> ISSUER			 Albania's Finance Ministry</p>
<p> AUCTION DATE		    07.11.1996</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE			11.11.1996</p>
<p> MATURITY			  10.02.1997</p>
<p> AMOUNT			   949,000,000 Leks</p>
<p> DISCOUNT			  44,886,707 Leks</p>
<p> MINIMUM ACCEPTED YIELD	   19.9  pct</p>
<p> MAXIMUM ACCEPTED YIELD	   20.2  pct</p>
<p> AVERAGE WEIGHTED YIELD	   19.91 pct</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT/COVER		   94.97 pct</p>
<p> LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE	25,000,000  Leks</p>
<p> PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE  20    pct</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY		 quarterly</p>
<p>Auction No.140 of 182-day Albanian Government Treasury Bills</p>
<p> ISSUER			   Albania's Finance Ministry</p>
<p> AUCTION DATE		    07.11.1996</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE			11.11.1996</p>
<p> MATURITY			  12.05.1997</p>
<p> AMOUNT			  1.200,000,000 Leks</p>
<p> DISCOUNT			  118,625,321 Leks</p>
<p> MINIMUM YIELD			 22 pct</p>
<p> MAXIMUM YIELD			 22 pct</p>
<p> AVERAGE WEIGHTED YIELD	    22 pct</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT/COVER		   100 pct</p>
<p> LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE     1,200,000,000 Leks</p>
<p> PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE   22 pct</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY		semi-annually</p>
<p>Auction No.141 of 364-day Albanian Government Treasury Bills</p>
<p> ISSUER			 Albania's Finance Ministry</p>
<p> AUCTION DATE		    07.11.1996</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE			11.11.1996</p>
<p> MATURITY			  10.11.1997</p>
<p> AMOUNT			 2.000,000,000 Leks</p>
<p> DISCOUNT			 363,859,677 Leks</p>
<p> MINIMUM ACCEPTED YIELD	    22.3 pct</p>
<p> MAXIMUM YIELD			 22.3 pct</p>
<p> AVERAGE WEIGHTED YIELD	    22.3 pct</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT/COVER		    81.63 pct</p>
<p> LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE	   367,346,900 Leks</p>
<p> PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE   22.3 pct</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY		   annually</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
